OL,3,AEurope is pouring billions into space.
OL,4,ACan Glasgow's satellite industry keep
OL,5,Aup?
OL,6,
OL,7,FEurope is pouring billions into space.
OL,8,FCan Glasgow's satellite industry keep
OL,9,Fup?
OL,11,FIn 2005, a young space engineer called
OL,12,FCraig Clark moved back to his home city
OL,13,Fof Glasgow. He'd graduated from
OL,14,Funiversity just over a decade before,
OL,15,Fbut the only jobs he could find were
OL,16,Fsouth of the border. Now Craig wanted
OL,17,Fto start a company of his own. He
OL,18,Fcalled it Clyde Space.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
