OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEurope is pouring billions into space.
OL,4,ACan Glasgow's satellite industry keep
OL,5,Aup?
OL,6,
OL,7,FI went to school not far from the River
OL,8,FClyde, where Glasgow's shipbuilding
OL,9,Findustry earned a global reputation for
OL,10,Fcraftsmanship and engineering
OL,11,Fexcellence. There was a saying that I
OL,12,Fgrew up with: "The Clyde made Glasgow
OL,13,Fand Glasgow made the Clyde."
OL,15,FWhat I hadn't realised until recently
OL,16,Fwas that, in a different guise, that
OL,17,Ftradition is still alive. Two decades
OL,18,Flater, Glasgow is a European leader in
OL,19,Fbuilding small satellites.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
